    {
      "id": "jwt",
      "description": "JSON Web Tokens and other signed values: the header (`eyJ`, `eyA…` with a space, `ewo…`/`ew0…`/`ewk…` with a newline, carriage return or tab after the brace, `Cns`/`CXs`/`DXs`/`IHs`/`DQp7` with one before it, or any header before JSON claims, `.eyJ…`/`.e30`, and a signature) and every dotted part after it, whatever they hold, in base64url or standard Base64, also URL-encoded (a cookie-signature MAC, `.%2F…`). Glued after `_`, `-` or a URL-encoded byte, never inside a word (`keyJson…`).",
      "pattern": "(^|[^A-Za-z0-9]|%[0-9A-Fa-f]{2})(?:(?:eyJ|eyA|ew[ok0]|Cns|CXs|DXs|IHs|DQp7)[A-Za-z0-9_+/=-]{6,}|[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,}\\.(?:eyJ|eyA|ew[ok0]|e30)[A-Za-z0-9_+/=-]*)(?:\\.(?:[A-Za-z0-9_+/=-]|%(?:25)?(?:2[BbFf]|3[Dd]))*)+",
